%% Render: ~/.zcode/tools/mermaid-render/render.sh -i one-copied-trade.mmd -o ../images/one-copied-trade.png -b white -s 2 -w 1600
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as Leader wallet
    participant W as Worker
    participant H as Helius
    participant J as Jupiter
    participant D as Dashboard

    L-->>H: a funded buy lands on chain
    H-->>W: a push, or the 45s safety poll
    Note over W: classify and dedupe, reject events older than 90s,<br/>coalesce same-mint buys inside 60s
    W->>W: size at 0.25x, floor $2, ceiling $10
    W->>W: risk gates: deployed share, daily loss,<br/>price age, slippage, price impact
    W->>J: request a quote
    J-->>W: price and route
    alt paper mode
        W->>W: simulate the fill
    else live and armed
        W->>W: sign, submit, confirm
    end
    W->>D: position, fill, equity

    L-->>H: a sell lands on chain
    H-->>W: the sell
    Note over W: mirror the same fraction
    W->>D: close, profit and loss, loss streak

    Note over W,D: a position still open at 5h sells if green,<br/>otherwise 1.5h of grace, then a force close
